msgid "Chapter 8: Terran late game — Ghost, Nuke, Thor, Battlecruiser"
msgstr "第八章：人族后期——幽灵、核打击、雷神与战巡"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7485
msgctxt "7485@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Welcome to the StarCraft late game test campaign. Three chapters cover advanced units, skills, and tech for each race."
msgstr "欢迎来到星际后期机制测试。三章分别检验神族、异虫与人族的进阶单位、技能与科技树。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7486
msgctxt "7486@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "This mission tests Protoss late game: Templar, Psi Storm, and Carrier. Follow the objective list; no enemies."
msgstr "本关测试神族后期：圣堂、灵能风暴与航母。按目标清单逐步完成即可，无敌人干扰。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7487
msgctxt "7487@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "This mission tests Zerg late game: Spire, Ultralisk, Queen, and Burrow. Combat units come from upgrading larva at your Hatchery; research Burrow at your Spawning Pool, then morph a Zergling. Follow the objective list."
msgstr "本关测试异虫后期：飞龙塔、雷兽、女王与潜地。战斗单位由主巢旁幼虫升级获得；潜地在孵化池研究，再将跳虫变形为潜地形态。按目标清单逐步完成即可。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7488
msgctxt "7488@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "This mission tests Terran late game: Ghost, Nuke, Thor, and Battlecruiser. Train Thor and Battlecruiser from a Factory or Starport with an attached Tech Lab; if the starting Tech Lab is separate, Tab-select it and land the Factory to attach. Follow the objective list."
msgstr "本关测试人族后期：幽灵、核打击、雷神与战列巡航舰。雷神与战巡需在挂载科技实验室的工厂或星港训练；开局若科技实验室未对接，请用 Tab 选中后让工厂降落对接。按目标清单逐步完成即可。"

