msgid "Creep tumor"
msgstr "菌毯肿瘤"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7521
msgctxt "7521@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Spawn creep tumor"
msgstr "生成菌毯肿瘤"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7522
msgctxt "7522@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Extend creep tumor"
msgstr "延伸菌毯肿瘤"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7523
msgctxt "7523@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg: Creep tumor"
msgstr "异虫：菌毯肿瘤"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7524
msgctxt "7524@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Use the Queen to spawn a creep tumor, extend tumors toward the far square, then sacrifice a Drone for a Spawning Pool on marked creep."
msgstr "用女王在菌毯上生成肿瘤，向远处延伸，最后在标记菌毯格上工蜂献身建造孵化池。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7525
msgctxt "7525@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Spawn a creep tumor on creep near the Hatchery."
msgstr "在主巢附近菌毯上生成一座菌毯肿瘤。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7526
msgctxt "7526@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Extend creep tumors until the far square has creep, then build a Spawning Pool there."
msgstr "延伸菌毯肿瘤至远处格子，并在该格建造孵化池。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7530
msgctxt "7530@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Larva"
msgstr "幼虫"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7531
msgctxt "7531@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Inject Larva boost"
msgstr "注卵加速"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7532
msgctxt "7532@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Target a Hatchery to spawn 3 larva there."
msgstr "对主巢使用，在目标处生成 3 条幼虫。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7533
msgctxt "7533@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Target a Hatchery; for 30 seconds its train time is reduced by 30 percent."
msgstr "对主巢使用，30 秒内该建筑的训练时间缩短 30%。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7534
msgctxt "7534@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Places an invisible creep tumor on creep; it spreads creep nearby. The tumor itself is not visible—use Tab or move to that square to confirm."
msgstr "在菌毯格上放置一座隐形的菌毯肿瘤，它会向周围蔓延菌毯；肿瘤本身不可见，可通过 Tab 或移动至该格确认。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7535
msgctxt "7535@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Effect: train time -30%, lasting 30 seconds"
msgstr "效果：训练时间 -30%，持续 30 秒"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7536
msgctxt "7536@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Effect: summon 3 larva"
msgstr "效果：召唤幼虫 ×3"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7537
msgctxt "7537@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Effect: summon 1 creep tumor"
msgstr "效果：召唤菌毯肿瘤 ×1"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7539
msgctxt "7539@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Upgrade a larva to a Zergling"
msgstr "将幼虫升级为跳虫"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7540
msgctxt "7540@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "StarCraft Build Tests"
msgstr "星际建造机制测试"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7541
msgctxt "7541@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Chapter 1: Protoss psi field — build a Gateway beyond Nexus range."
msgstr "第一章：神族能量场——在主基地范围外建造传送门。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7542
msgctxt "7542@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Chapter 2: Zerg creep — spread, Spawning Pool, destroy Hatchery, Extractor on persist."
msgstr "第二章：异虫菌毯——蔓延、孵化池、摧毁主巢、残留菌毯上建萃取房。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7543
msgctxt "7543@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Chapter 3: Terran addon — attach a Tech Lab to the Barracks."
msgstr "第三章：人族附属——给兵营加装科技实验室。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7544
msgctxt "7544@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Chapter 4: Lift Barracks, leave Tech Lab, land Factory to recombine, train Tank."
msgstr "第四章：兵营起飞留实验室，工厂降落接管，训练攻城坦克。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7545
msgctxt "7545@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Chapter 5: Terran supply — build a Supply Depot, then train twelve Marines."
msgstr "第五章：人族人口——建造补给站，再训练十二名陆战队员。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7546
msgctxt "7546@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Protoss: Psi Field"
msgstr "神族：能量场"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7547
msgctxt "7547@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Build at least 4 Pylons along the path, then build a Gateway in square f1."
msgstr "沿路建造至少 4 座水晶塔，再在 f1 格建造传送门。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7548
msgctxt "7548@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Protoss psi field test complete."
msgstr "神族能量场测试完成。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7550
msgctxt "7550@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "StarCraft Mod Mechanics Tutorial"
msgstr "星际模组机制教程"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7552
msgctxt "7552@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Welcome to the StarCraft mod mechanics tutorial. Eight missions total: the first five cover Protoss psi fields, Zerg creep, Terran addons, recombine, and supply; the last three cover late-game units, skills, and tech for each race."
msgstr "欢迎来到星际模组机制教程。全战役共八关：前五关讲解神族能量场、异虫菌毯、人族附属建筑、重组对接与人口补给；后三关分别体验神族、异虫与人族的后期单位、技能与科技树。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7553
msgctxt "7553@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Follow each mission's objective list at your own pace. There are no enemies."
msgstr "按每关目标清单逐步完成即可，无敌人干扰。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7600
msgctxt "7600@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "A mineral deposit. Workers gather minerals here and carry them back to a town hall."
msgstr "矿物矿脉。工人在此采集矿物并运回主基地。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7601
msgctxt "7601@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "A vespene geyser. Build a gas extractor on it before workers can harvest vespene."
msgstr "瓦斯气泉。需先建造采气建筑，工人才可采集高能瓦斯。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7602
msgctxt "7602@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Protoss town hall. Stores resources, trains Probes, provides 10 supply, and projects a psi field for nearby construction."
msgstr "神族主基地。储存资源、训练探机、提供 10 人口，并向周围投射灵能场供其他建筑建造。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7603
msgctxt "7603@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Extends the psi field and provides 8 supply. Most Protoss structures must be built within powered range."
msgstr "延伸灵能场范围并提供 8 人口。多数神族建筑必须在供能范围内才能建造。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7604
msgctxt "7604@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Trains Zealots and Dragoons. The core production building for Protoss ground forces."
msgstr "训练狂热者与龙骑士，是神族地面部队的核心生产建筑。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7605
msgctxt "7605@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Built on a vespene geyser. Probes gather vespene here and return it to the Nexus."
msgstr "建在瓦斯气泉上。探机在此采集瓦斯并运回主基地。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7606
msgctxt "7606@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "A defensive structure that attacks nearby enemies. Can be warped anywhere without requiring a psi field."
msgstr "自动攻击附近敌人的防御建筑。可在任意位置折跃，无需灵能场。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7607
msgctxt "7607@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Protoss worker. Gathers minerals and vespene, and warps in Protoss buildings within the psi field."
msgstr "神族工人。采集矿物与瓦斯，并在灵能场范围内折跃神族建筑。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7608
msgctxt "7608@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Melee infantry with strong shields. Cheap front-line unit trained from the Gateway."
msgstr "近战步兵，护盾较强。从传送门训练的廉价前线单位。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7609
msgctxt "7609@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Researches ground weapon upgrades for Zealots, Dragoons, and Dark Templars."
msgstr "研究地面武器升级，强化狂热者、龙骑士与黑暗圣堂武士。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7610
msgctxt "7610@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Dragoon production and researches shield and Singularity Charge upgrades."
msgstr "解锁龙骑士训练，并研究护盾与奇点充能升级。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7611
msgctxt "7611@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Observer and Phoenix production. Requires a Cybernetics Core."
msgstr "解锁侦察机与凤凰训练。需要先建造控制核心。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7612
msgctxt "7612@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Ranged infantry requiring a Cybernetics Core. Fires anti-armor attacks from distance."
msgstr "需控制核心的远程步兵，可对装甲单位造成远程伤害。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7613
msgctxt "7613@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Invisible detector with extended sight. Reveals cloaked and burrowed enemies without attacking."
msgstr "隐形探测器，视野广阔。可发现隐形与潜地单位，自身不主动攻击。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7614
msgctxt "7614@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg town hall. Stores resources, provides 10 supply, spawns larva, and spreads creep for Zerg construction."
msgstr "异虫主基地。储存资源、提供 10 人口、生成幼虫，并铺设菌毯供异虫建造。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7615
msgctxt "7615@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Required for Zergling production. Also researches melee, carapace, metabolic boost, and Burrow upgrades."
msgstr "解锁跳虫训练，并研究近战、甲壳、代谢增强与潜地升级。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7616
msgctxt "7616@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Built on a vespene geyser. Drones gather vespene here after a Drone is sacrificed to build it."
msgstr "建在瓦斯气泉上。工蜂献身建造后，可在此采集瓦斯。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7617
msgctxt "7617@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg worker. Gathers resources and is sacrificed to morph into Zerg structures on creep."
msgstr "异虫工人。采集资源，并在菌毯上献身变形为异虫建筑。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7618
msgctxt "7618@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Fast melee swarmer requiring a Spawning Pool. Cheap and quick to produce in large numbers."
msgstr "需孵化池的快速近战单位。造价低廉，可快速量产形成虫海。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7619
msgctxt "7619@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Roach production. Requires a Spawning Pool."
msgstr "解锁蟑螂训练。需要先建造孵化池。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7620
msgctxt "7620@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Hydralisk production and missile attack upgrades. Requires a Spawning Pool."
msgstr "解锁刺蛇训练及远程攻击升级。需要先建造孵化池。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7621
msgctxt "7621@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Armored ground unit with moderate armor. Good all-around front-line fighter from the Roach Warren."
msgstr "来自蟑螂巢穴的装甲地面单位，护甲适中，适合作为中坚前排。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7622
msgctxt "7622@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Ranged unit attacking from distance. Effective against air and ground targets from the Hydralisk Den."
msgstr "来自刺蛇巢穴的远程单位，可对空对地，在后方输出伤害。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7623
msgctxt "7623@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Flying supply unit providing 8 population. Essential for expanding the Zerg army early on."
msgstr "飞行补给单位，提供 8 人口。前期扩军必备。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7624
msgctxt "7624@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran town hall. Stores resources, trains SCVs, and provides 10 supply."
msgstr "人族主基地。储存资源、训练工程车、提供 10 人口。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7625
msgctxt "7625@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Trains Marines. Can attach a Tech Lab or Reactor, and can lift off to relocate."
msgstr "训练陆战队员。可挂载科技实验室或反应堆，并可起飞迁移。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7626
msgctxt "7626@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "A Barracks that has lifted off. Move it to a new location, then land to resume training."
msgstr "已起飞的兵营。移动至新位置后降落即可恢复训练。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7627
msgctxt "7627@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Trains Hellions. Can attach a Tech Lab or Reactor, and can lift off to relocate."
msgstr "训练恶火。可挂载科技实验室或反应堆，并可起飞迁移。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7628
msgctxt "7628@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "A Factory that has lifted off. Move it to a new location, then land to resume training."
msgstr "已起飞的工厂。移动至新位置后降落即可恢复训练。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7629
msgctxt "7629@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Trains air units when combined with addons. Can attach a Tech Lab or Reactor, and can lift off."
msgstr "配合附属建筑训练空军。可挂载科技实验室或反应堆，并可起飞迁移。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7630
msgctxt "7630@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Built on a vespene geyser. SCVs gather vespene here and return it to the Command Center."
msgstr "建在瓦斯气泉上。工程车在此采集瓦斯并运回指挥中心。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7631
msgctxt "7631@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Researches infantry weapon, armor, and Stim Pack upgrades for Terran infantry."
msgstr "研究步兵武器、护甲与兴奋剂升级。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7632
msgctxt "7632@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Researches vehicle and ship weapon and armor upgrades. Required for Thor and Battlecruiser tech."
msgstr "研究载具与舰船武器、护甲升级。训练雷神与战列巡航舰的前置建筑。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7633
msgctxt "7633@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Defensive structure that can garrison four infantry units for protection and fire support."
msgstr "可容纳四名步兵的防御建筑，提供掩护与火力支援。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7634
msgctxt "7634@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Provides 8 supply. Build more when approaching the population cap."
msgstr "提供 8 人口。接近人口上限时记得增建。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7635
msgctxt "7635@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "A Starport that has lifted off. Move it to a new location, then land to resume training."
msgstr "已起飞的星港。移动至新位置后降落即可恢复训练。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7636
msgctxt "7636@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Addon that unlocks advanced units: Marauder from Barracks, Tank and Thor from Factory, Medivac and Battlecruiser from Starport."
msgstr "附属建筑，解锁进阶单位：兵营出劫掠者，工厂出坦克与雷神，星港出医疗运输机与战列巡航舰。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7637
msgctxt "7637@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Addon that doubles production speed from its host Barracks, Factory, or Starport."
msgstr "附属建筑，使宿主兵营、工厂或星港的训练速度翻倍。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7638
msgctxt "7638@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran worker. Gathers minerals and vespene, and constructs Terran buildings on the battlefield."
msgstr "人族工人。采集矿物与瓦斯，并在战场上建造人族建筑。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7639
msgctxt "7639@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Basic ranged infantry from the Barracks. Cheap backbone of the Terran army; can use Stim Pack."
msgstr "兵营基础远程步兵，造价低廉，是人族军队骨干，可使用兴奋剂。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7640
msgctxt "7640@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Heavy infantry trained from a Barracks with Tech Lab. Slower but tougher than Marines."
msgstr "需兵营挂载科技实验室的重型步兵，比陆战队员更耐打。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7641
msgctxt "7641@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Fast vehicle from the Factory. Excels at raiding lightly armored targets."
msgstr "工厂出产的快速载具，擅长袭击轻甲目标。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7642
msgctxt "7642@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Armored tank from a Factory with Tech Lab. Can morph into Siege Mode for long-range bombardment."
msgstr "需工厂挂载科技实验室的装甲坦克，可变形为攻城模式进行远程炮击。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7643
msgctxt "7643@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Stationary artillery form of the Siege Tank. Long range and splash damage, but cannot move while sieged."
msgstr "攻城坦克的固定炮击形态。射程远、带溅射，但无法移动。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7644
msgctxt "7644@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Air transport from a Starport with Tech Lab. Carries ground units and heals nearby infantry."
msgstr "需星港挂载科技实验室的空中运输单位，可运载地面部队并治疗附近步兵。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7645
msgctxt "7645@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks High Templar and Dark Templar training and Psi Storm research. Requires a Cybernetics Core."
msgstr "解锁高阶与黑暗圣堂训练及灵能风暴研究。需先建造控制核心。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7646
msgctxt "7646@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Carrier production and air weapon and armor upgrades. Requires a Stargate."
msgstr "解锁航母训练及空军武器、护甲升级。需先建造星门。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7647
msgctxt "7647@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Psionic caster trained from the Templar Archives. Casts Psi Storm to devastate grouped enemies."
msgstr "自圣堂文献馆训练的灵能施法者，可释放灵能风暴重创密集敌人。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7648
msgctxt "7648@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Stealth melee assassin from the Templar Archives. Invisible until attacking; high burst damage up close."
msgstr "自圣堂文献馆训练的隐形近战刺客，攻击前不可见，近身爆发极高。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7649
msgctxt "7649@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Anti-air fighter from the Stargate. Fast and effective against enemy air units."
msgstr "自星门训练的制空战斗机，速度快，专克敌方空中单位。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7650
msgctxt "7650@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Capital ship from the Fleet Beacon. Heavy air unit with long-range anti-air attacks and splash damage."
msgstr "自舰队航标训练的主力舰，远程对空攻击并附带溅射伤害。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7651
msgctxt "7651@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Mutalisk production and flyer attack and carapace upgrades. Requires a Spawning Pool."
msgstr "解锁异龙训练及飞龙攻击、甲壳升级。需先建造孵化池。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7652
msgctxt "7652@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Ultralisk production. Requires a Spire."
msgstr "解锁雷兽训练。需先建造飞龙塔。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7653
msgctxt "7653@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Unlocks Queen production. Requires a Spawning Pool."
msgstr "解锁女王训练。需先建造孵化池。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7654
msgctxt "7654@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Fast air harasser from the Spire. Attacks both ground and air targets."
msgstr "自飞龙塔训练的快速空中骚扰单位，可对空对地。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7655
msgctxt "7655@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Heavy melee beast from the Ultralisk Cavern. High health and damage; crushes enemy ground armies."
msgstr "自雷兽窟训练的重量级近战巨兽，生命与伤害极高，可碾压地面部队。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7656
msgctxt "7656@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Support caster from the Queen's Nest. Spawns larva, injects Hatcheries, and spreads creep tumors."
msgstr "自女王巢穴训练的后勤施法者，可孵化幼虫、注卵并铺设菌毯肿瘤。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7657
msgctxt "7657@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Invisible structure placed by the Queen. Spreads creep nearby so Zerg can build farther from the Hatchery."
msgstr "女王放置的隐形建筑，向周围蔓延菌毯，使异虫可在远离主巢处建造。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7658
msgctxt "7658@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Burrowed Zergling. Invisible and stationary until unburrowed; requires Burrow research at the Spawning Pool."
msgstr "潜地形态的跳虫。隐形且静止，需先在孵化池研究潜地；可钻出恢复移动。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7659
msgctxt "7659@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Larva spawned by the Hatchery. Upgrade larva into any unlocked Zerg unit type."
msgstr "主巢生成的幼虫。可升级为任意已解锁的异虫单位。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7660
msgctxt "7660@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Trains Ghosts and researches Cloaking and Nuclear Strike. Requires a Barracks."
msgstr "训练幽灵并研究隐形与核打击。需先建造兵营。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7661
msgctxt "7661@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Covert operative from the Ghost Academy. Long-range attacks; can cloak and launch Nuclear Strike."
msgstr "自幽灵军校训练的特种单位，远程攻击，可隐形并发射核打击。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7662
msgctxt "7662@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Cloaked Ghost. Invisible until attacking or detected; retains nuke capability."
msgstr "隐形状态的幽灵，攻击或被发现前不可见，仍可使用核打击。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7663
msgctxt "7663@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Massive walker from a Factory with Tech Lab and Armory. Heavy splash damage at long range."
msgstr "需工厂挂载科技实验室且建造军械库后训练的巨型步行机甲，远程溅射伤害。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7664
msgctxt "7664@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran capital ship from a Starport with Tech Lab and Armory. Can use Yamato Cannon against high-value targets."
msgstr "需星港挂载科技实验室且建造军械库后训练的主力舰，可使用大和炮打击高价值目标。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7680
msgctxt "7680@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "StarCraft: Skills Test"
msgstr "星际：技能综合测试"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7681
msgctxt "7681@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Welcome to the skills sandbox. Terran zone on the left, Protoss in the center, Zerg on the right; neutral Zealots at the far east (o) for AoE skills. Required upgrades are already researched and units are ready. High Templar starts at zero energy — wait until 75 mana for Psi Storm. Wound a Marine before testing Medivac heal. No auto-win; press F9 and verify each skill manually."
msgstr "欢迎来到技能综合测试场。左侧为人族、中间为神族、右侧为异虫测试区；最东侧 o 格有中立狂热者集群，供范围技能试放。所有前置升级已研究，单位与建筑已就绪。高阶圣堂武士需先等待灵能回满（约 75 点）再释放灵能风暴。医疗运输机治疗前请先将一名陆战队员打至受伤。本图无自动通关，按 F9 查看技能清单逐项验证即可。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7682
msgctxt "7682@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Press F9 for the skill checklist. Manually verify that each skill can be cast."
msgstr "按 F9 查看技能测试清单，逐项手动验证各技能是否可正常施放。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7683
msgctxt "7683@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran: select a Marine or Marauder and use Stim Pack."
msgstr "人族：选中陆战队员或劫掠者，使用兴奋剂。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7684
msgctxt "7684@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran: select a Medivac and heal wounded infantry."
msgstr "人族：选中医疗运输机，对受伤步兵使用治疗。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7685
msgctxt "7685@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran: select a Ghost and launch Nuclear Strike on the zealots at o."
msgstr "人族：选中幽灵，对 o 格敌军使用核打击。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7686
msgctxt "7686@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Terran: select a Battlecruiser and use Yamato Cannon on the zealots at o."
msgstr "人族：选中战列巡航舰，对 o 格敌军使用大和炮。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7687
msgctxt "7687@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Protoss: select a High Templar and cast Psi Storm on the zealots at o (75 mana)."
msgstr "神族：选中高阶圣堂武士，对 o 格敌军使用灵能风暴（需 75 灵能）。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7688
msgctxt "7688@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg: select the Queen and Spawn Larva on the Hatchery."
msgstr "异虫：选中女王，对主巢使用孵化幼虫。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7689
msgctxt "7689@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg: select the Queen and Inject Larva on the Hatchery."
msgstr "异虫：选中女王，对主巢使用注卵加速。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7690
msgctxt "7690@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg: select the Queen and Spawn Creep Tumor on creep."
msgstr "异虫：选中女王，在菌毯上使用生成菌毯肿瘤。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7691
msgctxt "7691@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "Zerg: select a Creep Tumor and Extend Creep Tumor on a marked creep square."
msgstr "异虫：选中菌毯肿瘤，在已标记的菌毯格上延伸肿瘤。"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7692
msgctxt "7692@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "light armor"
msgstr "轻甲"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7693
msgctxt "7693@mods/starcraft/ui"
msgid "armored"
msgstr "重甲"

#: mods/starcraft/ui/tts.txt:7694
msgctxt "7694@mods/starcraft/ui"
