#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8500
msgctxt "8500@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "The Turks were about to invade the borders of the Tang Dynasty, and the Tang Empire was filled with the atmosphere of an imminent war."
msgstr "突厥即将大举扣边，大唐境内充满了战争即将来临的气氛。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8501
msgctxt "8501@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "The marshal intends to send you to the border to garrison, and prepare for war.Note: Do not stay too far from the border."
msgstr "元帅派遣你去编进驻防，厉兵秣马，准备开战。注意，如果不是万不得已就不要远离边境。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8502
msgctxt "8502@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Nicely done!"
msgstr "干的不错"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8504
msgctxt "8504@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "The vanguard of the Turkic army is coming, we must give them a head-on blow and frustrate them, by the way, we don't have many cavalry, so we have to use them in the right place."
msgstr "突厥的先头部队就要来了，我们必须给与他们迎头痛击，挫其锐气，对了，咱们的骑兵并不多，因此要用在正确的地方。"

#. only defined in a translation layer under mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui, no matching key in that tree's own ui/tts.txt
#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8505
msgctxt "8505@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "击退突厥先头部队"
msgstr "击退突厥先头部队"

#. only defined in a translation layer under mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui, no matching key in that tree's own ui/tts.txt
#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8506
msgctxt "8506@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "看到了吗？b4的地势较高，如果将弓箭手安放在此的话，择箭可以射的更远，敌人弱不付出一定的代价休想攻上来，尽力守住这块儿高地吧，同时这里也是城池的出入口，只要守住这里敌人就无法攻入。"
msgstr "看到了吗？b4的地势较高，如果将弓箭手安放在此的话，择箭可以射的更远，敌人弱不付出一定的代价休想攻上来，尽力守住这块儿高地吧，同时这里也是城池的出入口，只要守住这里敌人就无法攻入。"

#. only defined in a translation layer under mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui, no matching key in that tree's own ui/tts.txt
#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8507
msgctxt "8507@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "这些长矛兵是敌人的试探，长矛兵克制骑兵，因此如果数量相同，万不可用骑兵对抗长矛兵，应当用陌刀手或者便宜的弓箭手。"
msgstr "这些长矛兵是敌人的试探，长矛兵克制骑兵，因此如果数量相同，万不可用骑兵对抗长矛兵，应当用陌刀手或者便宜的弓箭手。"

#. only defined in a translation layer under mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui, no matching key in that tree's own ui/tts.txt
#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8508
msgctxt "8508@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "在对付骑兵方面，咱们大唐陌刀手说第二没人敢说第一。"
msgstr "在对付骑兵方面，咱们大唐陌刀手说第二没人敢说第一。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8509
msgctxt "8509@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Building a village"
msgstr "建设一个村落"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8510
msgctxt "8510@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Building a barracks"
msgstr "建设一座校场"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8511
msgctxt "8511@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Chapter 1: Pre-war preparations"
msgstr "第一张：战前准备"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8512
msgctxt "8512@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Chapter 2: Preparation of soldiers and horses"
msgstr "第二章：厉兵秣马"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8530
msgctxt "8530@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "After learning the basic construction of buildings, you need to learn to upgrade your base, recruit troops and other operations."
msgstr "在学会了基本的建设建筑以后，接下来你需要学会升级基地，募兵等操作。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8531
msgctxt "8531@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Beginner Instruction"
msgstr "新手教学"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8532
msgctxt "8532@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Upgrade the county office to governor office, recruit 20 pikemen, 20 archers, 20 modao_footman, 20 light cavalry, 5 marching carts, 5 siege_vehicle, 5 taoist_priest and 5 basilisk cavalry."
msgstr "将县衙升级到督抚，招募20个长枪兵，20个弓箭手，20个陌刀手，20个轻骑兵，5个行军车，5个投石车，5个道医和5个玄甲骑兵。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8533
msgctxt "8533@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Upgrading county_offices to governors_office"
msgstr "将县衙升级到督抚"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8534
msgctxt "8534@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Recruit 20 pikemen, 20 archers, 20 modao_footman 20 light cavalry"
msgstr "招募20个长枪兵，20个弓箭手，20个陌刀手和20个轻骑兵"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8535
msgctxt "8535@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Recruiting 5 marching carts and 5 siege_vehicle"
msgstr "招募 5个行军车和5个投石车"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8536
msgctxt "8536@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Recruit 5 taoist_priest and 5 black cavalry"
msgstr "招募5个道医和5个玄甲骑兵"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8537
msgctxt "8537@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Well done, once the barracks are available, you can upgrade your base to level 2."
msgstr "干得很好，当有了校场之后，你就可以将你的基地升到2级了。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8538
msgctxt "8538@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "You have met the requirements to upgrade your base to level 3."
msgstr "你已经满足了将基地升到3级的条件。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8539
msgctxt "8539@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Chapter 3: Combat Skills"
msgstr "第三章：作战技巧"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8540
msgctxt "8540@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Now that the troops are sufficient, it's time to get familiar with the combat aspect. The game has a certain type of restraint relationship, in general, the gun and spear class grams cavalry, cavalry grams long-range, long-range grams gun and spear class and heavy infantry, siege equipment grams long-range, in addition to the overall restraint, there are more detailed restraint relationship waiting for you to explore."
msgstr "现在兵力已经充足，该熟悉一下作战环节了。该游戏有着一定的兵种克制关系，总体来说，枪兵和重步兵克骑兵，骑兵克远程，远程克枪兵和重步兵，攻城器械克远程，除了总体上的克制，还有更加细致的克制关系等待你的探索。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8541
msgctxt "8541@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "The northern Turkic army has always been a threat to our Tang Empire, relying on the cavalry advantage to come and go, often forcing our troops to run for their lives. The scouts have really found a considerable number of Turkic troops wandering not far from the border of our Tang Empire with unknown purpose. After discussion, we decided to take a risk and sneak out of the city to attack their camp."
msgstr "北方突厥一直以来都是我大唐之心腹大患，依仗着骑兵优势说来就来说走就走，往往迫使我军疲于奔命。斥候真查到了有一只数量可观的突厥军队在我大唐边境不远徘徊，目的不明。经过商讨，我们决定冒一次险，出城偷营。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8542
msgctxt "8542@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Destroy all enemies"
msgstr "消灭所有敌人"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8543
msgctxt "8543@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Chapter 4: A Head-On Attack."
msgstr "第四章：迎头痛击。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8544
msgctxt "8544@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "From this chapter will enter the real battle session, the enemy will launch round after round of attacks, the time to test the overall quality of the player has arrived."
msgstr "从本章开始将进入真正的对战环节，敌方会发起一轮又一轮的攻势，考验玩家综合素质的时候到了。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8545
msgctxt "8545@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Chapter 5: The Final Showdown"
msgstr "第五章：最终决战"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8546
msgctxt "8546@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "The main force of the Turk has pressed into our army in full force, it seems that a vicious battle is imminent, and I think it will be quite tragic."
msgstr "突厥的主力已经全面压进，看来一场恶战迫在眉睫，想必会相当惨烈吧。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8549
msgctxt "8549@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Hold on to the city"
msgstr "坚守城池"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8551
msgctxt "8551@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "report.... Just received the news, the marshal is worried about our defending the city's strength is tight, decided to send a don't reinforce us, hope the general must ensure that the city is not lost."
msgstr "报。。。刚收到的消息，大帅担心我们守城兵力吃紧，决定派出一只别不增员我们，望将军务必保证城池不失。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8552
msgctxt "8552@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "Look, it's reinforcements, reinforcements are here, at b5!!!"
msgstr "快看，是援军，援军到了，在b5！！！"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8553
msgctxt "8553@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "This was the last wave of support given to us by the marshal, and we were concerned about losses, so this support entered the city through the south gate, at a3 and c3."
msgstr "这是大帅给我们的最后一波支援，我们担心有所损失，因此这批支援是从南门进城的，在a3和c3。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8554
msgctxt "8554@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "The battle has come to such a level that you did not expect, now the soldiers are sleepy, the city is desperate for food, but the Turkic offensive does not seem to weaken at all, you can not help but start to worry, so you decided to call the general officers to discuss countermeasures."
msgstr "仗打到现在这种程度也是你没预料到的，如今将士们人困马乏，城内粮食告急，然而突厥的攻势似乎一点也没有减弱的迹象，你的心理不由地开始担忧了起来，于是你决定召集众将官商量对策。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8555
msgctxt "8555@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "After discussion, we all agreed that we can't stick to the city gates, we should consider the situation after the gates are broken, after repeated discussion and deduction, you came up with the countermeasure of using the complex terrain inside the city to restrain the enemy, weak things can't be done, when immediately give up the city gates, retreat to the city."
msgstr "经过讨论，大家一致认为不能执着于兼顾的城门，应当考虑城门破了之后的情况，在反复的探讨和推演之后，你们想到了用城内复杂的地形牵制敌人的对策，弱事不可为，当立即放弃城门，退守城内。"

#: mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui/tts.txt:8556
msgctxt "8556@mods/tang/single/tang campaign/ui"
msgid "In you already feel stretched to the limit, there is nothing to do, but suddenly found that the opposite Turkic camp seems to be slowly retreating, while the opposite also came the sound of sounding gold, Zheng Yu you base station of the Turkic army heard immediately after the formula stopped, quickly disengaged from the battlefield. It turns out does not mean that you guys feel helpless, the opposite Turkic equally clueless, in the case of paying such a large number of casualties also did not take this city, the morale of the Turkic army has fallen to the bottom, has not been suitable to continue to fight, while they fear that your main force will feel at any time, and decided to give up this city and seek another way."
msgstr "在你们已经觉得捉襟见肘，无计可施的时候，却突然发现对面突厥大营似乎正在缓缓后撤，同时对面也传来了鸣金的声音，郑宇你们基站的突厥军队闻听之后立即停止了公式，迅速脱离了战场。原来并不指你们觉得无计可施，对面突厥同样毫无办法，在付出了如此之大的伤亡也没有攻下此城的情况下，突厥大军的士气已经跌落到了谷底，已经不适宜继续作战，同时他们担心你们的主力随时都会感到，于是决定放弃此城，另求他路。"

