#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7500
msgctxt "7500@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "The northern marches burn. The Chancellor's agents spread lies; border garrisons turn on one another. The King's messenger finds Raynor — a knight once exiled, now the only soul brave enough to face the dark. \"Reclaim the frontier,\" the messenger whispers. \"The realm's fate rests in your hands.\""
msgstr "王国北境烽火连天。宰相的爪牙散布谣言，边境守军各自为战。国王的密使找到了雷诺——一位曾被流放、如今唯一敢直面黑暗的骑士。\"夺回边境，\"密使低声道，\"王国的命运系于你手。\""

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7501
msgctxt "7501@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Raynor reaches the frontier ruins with a handful of survivors. Scouts report enemy probes nearby. Build a house and barracks — this is your first foothold in the north."
msgstr "雷诺率残部抵达边境废墟。斥候回报：敌军探子就在附近。先建起房屋与兵营，站稳脚跟——这是你在北境的第一座据点。"

#: res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui/tts.txt:7502
msgctxt "7502@res/single/The Legend of Raynor/ui"
msgid "Hammers ring in the new barracks. Smoke rises over the young outpost. Raynor knows the long war has only just begun — and the enemy will grant little time to breathe."
msgstr "兵营的锤声响起，炊烟袅袅升起。雷诺望着初具规模的据点，知道漫长征途才刚开头——而敌人，绝不会给他太多喘息的时间。"

