#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5765
msgctxt "5765"
msgid "The primary voice library is used for menus and player actions outside matches, and for production and economy feedback in matches. If a screen reader such as Zhengdu or NVDA is detected, the screen reader takes over the primary voice role to avoid fighting the primary library."
msgstr "主语音库用于对局外的菜单与玩家操作，以及对局内生产与经济反馈。若检测到屏幕阅读器（争渡/NVDA等），则读屏接管主语音职责，避免与主库抢播。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5766
msgctxt "5766"
msgid "Prefer a screen reader as the primary voice when possible, so F9 through F12 need not be used for the primary library. Hotkeys in this game are very dense and nearly saturated, so save keys when you can. The secondary library can still be adjusted with Shift plus F9 through F12."
msgstr "建议尽量用读屏软件或屏幕阅读器作为主语音：这样不必再占用F9到F12去调节主库。本游戏热键非常密集、几乎饱和，容易冲突，能省则省；副库仍可用Shift加F9到F12调节。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5767
msgctxt "5767"
msgid "The secondary voice library is used for passive battlefield events in matches, such as casualties and discovering enemies."
msgstr "副语音库用于对局内战场被动事件，例如伤亡与发现敌人。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5768
msgctxt "5768"
msgid "Left Alt skips or interrupts the primary voice library. Right Alt skips or interrupts the secondary voice library. In-match actions do not interrupt the secondary library."
msgstr "左 Alt 跳过或打断主语音库，右 Alt 跳过或打断副语音库；对局内操作不会打断副库。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5769
msgctxt "5769"
msgid "When secondary voice is disabled, either Alt key can skip the current utterance."
msgstr "禁用副语音时左右 Alt 均可跳过当前播报。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5770
msgctxt "5770"
msgid "You can enable or disable secondary voice in this menu. When disabled, the primary voice handles all speech, same as single-channel mode. When enabled, primary and secondary roles are restored."
msgstr "可在本菜单启用或禁用副语音：禁用后主语音接管全部播报（与单通道模式相同）；启用后恢复主副分工。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5771
msgctxt "5771"
msgid "In any menu, press F3 to toggle secondary voice. This does nothing during a match."
msgstr "在任意菜单中按 F3 也可切换副语音（对局内无效）。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5772
msgctxt "5772"
msgid "In any menu, press F4 to toggle accessibility voice. When off, TTS is silenced so sighted players can use the display. Press F4 again to turn it back on. During a match, F4 remains the help screen."
msgstr "在任意菜单中按 F4 可开关无障碍语音：关闭后不再播报 TTS，方便明眼人用画面游玩；再按 F4 可重新开启（对局内 F4 仍是帮助界面）。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5773
msgctxt "5773"
msgid "In voice library settings, use up and down arrows to select a parameter, and left and right arrows to adjust it."
msgstr "在语音库设置中：上下光标选择参数，左右光标调整。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5774
msgctxt "5774"
msgid "In-match hotkeys: F9 changes the sound card, F10 changes the parameter type, F11 and F12 adjust the current parameter."
msgstr "局内热键：F9切换声卡，F10切换参数类型，F11和F12调节当前参数。"

#. VOICE_LIB_HELP
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5775
msgctxt "5775"
msgid "Shift plus F9 through F12 adjust the secondary library. Right Shift plus C copies the latest secondary utterance. Right Shift plus B appends the secondary utterance to the clipboard. Left Shift plus C and Left Shift plus B are commented out by default in global_bindings.txt; remove the leading semicolon to enable them."
msgstr "Shift加F9到F12调节副库。右Shift加C复制副库最近播报，右Shift加B追加副库到剪贴板。左Shift加C与左Shift加B默认在global_bindings.txt中注释；若要用，去掉行首分号即可启用。"

#. VOICE_LIB_SECONDARY_OFF
#: res/ui/tts.txt:5776
msgctxt "5776"
msgid "secondary voice is disabled, primary voice handles all speech"
msgstr "副语音已禁用，主语音接管全部播报"

